  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A tall upright figure with one squared shoulder plate and a long, broad fantasy blade held diagonally downward. A short rectangular back-banner creates a distinctive vertical behind the head.",
    "face": "Medium-brown skin, close-cropped dark hair, brown eyes and a composed, focused expression. A pale eyebrow streak is a natural hair accent rather than an injury story.",
    "costume": "Deep red fitted coat under partial silver plate, broad belt, cream trousers and knee boots. The asymmetric armor leaves a clear leading and trailing side.",
    "palette": "Crimson #A4464D; cream #E3D7BA; silver #A6B5BF; midnight #344155.",
    "equipment": "Broad two-handed fantasy blade and a short banner fixed to a rigid back bracket. The banner is cosmetic; no area buff or faction system is implied.",
    "signature": "Single large shoulder plate, upright back-banner and long diagonal blade.",
    "materials": "Matte cloth and brushed steel with sparse clean edge highlights. Bake banner folds or use two accessory bones; no cloth solver.",
    "back": "A rigid banner bracket attaches visibly to the harness, leaving shoulder motion clear. The cloth stops above the hips.",
    "animation": "Idle keeps the blade low and feet apart. Basics are short two-handed cuts. The active pulls the blade inward and delivers one measured forward strike; the banner follows slightly after the torso.",
    "vfx": "A single narrow warm-white trail and compact impact spark. No splash damage, armor break or knockback.",
    "audio": "One firm cloth movement and a clean resonant hit; no shouted voice requirement.",
    "risk": "Banner silhouette must not overlap health bars or obscure the next row. Validate that a two-handed pose works with the shared standard rig."
  },
